cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Bug-bounty rejection taxonomy: 111 logged submissions classified by triage outcome and earliest catchable gate"
abstract: >-
  A personal log of 111 rejected bug-bounty submissions, each classified by the
  triage outcome, the earliest gate that could have caught it before submission,
  and the root-cause class. 80 of 111 (72.1%) were catchable by six pre-hunt gates
  alone. The dataset carries no target dimension: no protocol, chain, ecosystem,
  date or severity is published.
type: dataset
